          <div class="svc-not-item"><div class="svc-not-ico"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M3 3l6 6M9 3l-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><div><strong>Not a template download.</strong> Every artefact is authored to your actual data flows, not copy-paste from a library.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-not-item"><div class="svc-not-ico"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M3 3l6 6M9 3l-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><div><strong>Not a DPO retainer.</strong> DPO-as-a-Service is on our roadmap; this engagement is a one-time build.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-not-item"><div class="svc-not-ico"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M3 3l6 6M9 3l-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><div><strong>Not an incident-response service.</strong> We set up the breach-notification process; actual response support is a separate engagement.</div></div>
