            <p class="svc-team-role">Engagement Lead</p>
            <h3 class="svc-team-name">Manoj Prabhakaran</h3>
            <p class="svc-team-certs">ISO 27001 Lead Auditor · GRC Mastery · CPTS · CDSA · Security+ · Azure Cloud Security</p>
            <p class="svc-team-focus"><strong>Focus:</strong> Data mapping, RoPA, privacy instrument authoring, DPIA methodology, cross-border transfer assessment. <strong>Approach:</strong> every document authored to your actual processing — not copy-paste templates.</p>
          </div>
